    इति
    प्रत्यागमनम् यन्त्रचिह्नान्तः ।
इति

॰ lower_vector(rt, v, op, args) — `Vector(op, [dst, a, b])` EXPANDED IN PLACE into
॰ the design's strip-mined loop (D3), line for line `riscv64.rs`'s `lower_vector`,
॰ whose margin carries the argument: the bases copied into `क्षणिक०`..`२`; the
॰ three lengths (header word at base−8, ० for a nil base) compared, UNEQUAL ones
॰ REFUSED with `मध्यरूपॱव्यूहदैर्घ्यनिषेधः` (FAIL form) at the finisher and a spin; the count
॰ written as the value; then `व्यूहदैर्घ्यम्` at e64/m8 (२१९), the two strips loaded
॰ into `व्यूह८`/`व्यूह१६`, the op into `व्यूह२४` (first source `vs2`, so `क − ख`),
॰ stored, and all three bases advanced by `vl × ८`. `व्यूह०` is never touched.
